-color: rgba(from\nvar(--color-border) r g b / 1.0); --border-radius:\n0px; \n\n\">\n\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <header>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <div \n  class=\" spacing-style text-block text-block--AU0U1T2x5aWhpaGVLO__blog-post-title h2\n    text-block--align-left\n  \"\n\n  style=\"\n    --padding-block-start: 0px; --padding-block-end:0px; \n--padding-inline-start:0px; --padding-inline-end:0px; \n\n    \n\n    --width: 100%;\n    --max-width: var(--max-width--body-normal);\n    \n      --text-align: left;\n    \n    \n  \"\n\n  \n>\n    <h1>Winter wellness: Hydration</h1>\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    </header><div id=\"shopify-block-ATi9ob3VrbUREb1ZlN__blog-post-content\" class=\"shopify-block\">\n\n<div class=\"blog-post-content rte\">\n  <rte-formatter>\n    <p>As the magical winter season sets in, our skin and joints also face the brunt of the dropping temperatures.</p>\n<p>Enter The Winter Dehydration Dilemma:</p>\n<p>Indoor Heating vs. Skin Moisture: Snuggling up indoors sounds ideal, but did you know your cosy heater is actually zapping moisture from the air and your skin?</p>\n<p>Low Humidity Levels: Winter air isn’t just cold; it’s dry. This lack of moisture can leave your skin with the all-too-familar dry and cracked feeling and appearance.</p>\n<p>The Hot Shower Paradox: Sure, they feel heavenly, but those steamy showers can strip away your skin’s natural protective oils.</p>\n<p>The key to maintaining hydration and suppleness lies in a naturally occurring superhero – <a href=\"https://ingeniouslife.com/hyaluronic-acid/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"9906\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Hyaluronic Acid (HA)</span></a>. HA isn’t just a component; it’s a hydration powerhouse. Found naturally in your body, it’s like a sponge that can hold up to 1,000 times its weight in water, making it a crucial element for skin hydration and joint lubrication.</p>\n<p>But here’s the twist – as we stride through life, our natural HA levels start to dip, leading to the all-too-familiar fine lines and loss of elasticity which are most often associated with visible aging. That’s where INGENIOUS comes into play, with our cutting-edge Full Spectrum Hyaluronan Complex that mimics the physiology of your body’s HA.</p>\n<p>Our skin contains varying lengths of HA molecules and the HA complex used in <a href=\"https://ingeniouslife.com/products/ingenious-collagen\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">INGENIOUS </span>Collagen+ </a> and <a href=\"https://ingeniouslife.com/ingenious-active/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"39396\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">INGENIOUS Active</span></a> match this structure; leading to 19% more superior results than traditional HA.</p>\n  </rte-formatter>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"shopify-block-AMnRTcDBMNmJnaGNYK__blog-post-product\" class=\"shopify-block\">\n\n\n    <div class=\"related-product-wrapper-bg\">\n        \n                <div class=\"related-product-wrapper\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"related-product-image\">\n                        <a href=\"/products/ingenious-active\">\n                            \n                                <img src=\"/assets/b53bbf30-Group_1073714960_copy.png\" alt=\"Active\" class=\"related-product-img\">\n                            \n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    \n                    <div class=\"related-product-details\">\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                        <h2 class=\"related-product-title\">ACTIVE</h2>\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                        <p class=\"related-product-description\">ENDURANCE & RECOVERY HYDROLYSED COLLAGEN CAPSULES</p>\n                    \n                    \n                    <span class=\"related-product-price\">From £32</span>\n\n                    \n                   